{"id":"c3bab3834d542fbb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-monorecog.md","title":"Positivity recognition from DNF is in coNP","display":"thm-monorecog — Positivity recognition from DNF is in coNP","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-monorecog","aliases":["27-thm-monorecog"],"display":"thm-monorecog — Positivity recognition from DNF is in coNP","depends_on":["[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-monotone]]","[[27-df-conp]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-monorecog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-monorecog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-monorecog — Positivity recognition from DNF is in coNP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9224d06d4526ac2\" href=\"?note=d9224d06d4526ac2\" title=\"27-df-conp\">27-df-conp</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\preceq b\">\\(a\\preceq b\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{coNP}\">\\(\\mathbf{coNP}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" href=\"?note=640eb8f2fbffd9d9\" title=\"27-df-monotone\">27-df-monotone</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d9224d06d4526ac2\" href=\"?note=d9224d06d4526ac2\" title=\"27-df-conp\">27-df-conp</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MONOREC}\">\\(\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\)</span> is the language to be defined over the binary alphabet <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbb B\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF}\\)</span> is the explicit binary encoding of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a>; malformed codes are rejected.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\in\\mathbf{coNP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\in\\mathbf{coNP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证书证明：非正性由 a≼b、EvalDNF(D)(a)=1、EvalDNF(D)(b)=0 见证；标准列表编码保证多项式证书及检验。来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §1.10.1, Theorem 1.20，印刷页 35，PDF 第 59 页（从 1 计数）。 此处只证明 membership，不据此推断更强算法下界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monotone]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"d9224d06d4526ac2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-conp]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monotone","status":"resolved","id":"640eb8f2fbffd9d9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNP}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]] and [[27-df-conp]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-conp","status":"resolved","id":"d9224d06d4526ac2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ and $\\mathbf{coNP}$ are defined in [[27-df-monotone]] and [[27-df-conp]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{encDNF}$ is the explicit binary encoding of [[27-df-encoding]]; malformed codes are rejected.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\preceq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{coNP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MONOREC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D):n\\in\\mathbb N\\land D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\land\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{MONOREC}\\in\\mathbf{coNP}.","display":true}],"bytes":1611,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-474","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-monorecog|thm-monorecog — Positivity recognition from DNF is in coNP]]"}],"outgoing":["42004383fb23d1fe","0b618255959ff4bc","640eb8f2fbffd9d9","d9224d06d4526ac2","5d10aed668d85817"]}